    "text": "The equivalents of ethylene diamine required to replace the neutral ligands from the coordination sphere of the trans-complex of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CoCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is&nbsp;_______ . (Round off to the Nearest Integer).",
    "image": null
